@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK SC"
skinparam shadowing false
hide footbox

participant "voime-gpu" as Worker
participant "资源包" as Model
participant "GPU runtime 包" as Runtime
participant "ONNX Runtime GPU" as Ort

Worker -> Model : 读取 firered/fire-red-aed/manifest.json
Worker -> Model : SHA-256 + 张量 / metadata 校验
Worker -> Runtime : 加载 ORT / EP
Worker -> Ort : 创建 encoder / decoder 会话
Ort -> Worker : Session

loop 每个 Final 段
  Worker -> Worker : fbank + CMVN
  Worker -> Ort : encoder / decoder 推理
  Ort -> Worker : logits / text
end

note over Worker
  模型只读；每个 Final 段独立解码，
  不保留跨段 KV cache。
end note
@enduml
